sequenceDiagram
    actor BusinessUser as Business User
    participant UI as React UI
    participant APIGW as API Gateway
    participant AuthAPI as Identity API
    participant RBAC as Role-Based Authorization
    participant RecordsAPI as Business Records API
    participant AuditService as Audit Service
    participant SQLDB as Azure SQL Database

    BusinessUser->>UI: Enter credentials
    activate UI
    UI->>APIGW: POST /api/auth/sign-in
    APIGW->>AuthAPI: Forward sign-in request
    activate AuthAPI
    alt Credentials valid
        AuthAPI->>SQLDB: SELECT user and roles
        SQLDB-->>AuthAPI: User record
        AuthAPI-->>UI: 200 OK with JWT access token
    else Credentials invalid
        AuthAPI-->>UI: 401 Unauthorized
        UI-->>BusinessUser: Show sign-in error
    end
    deactivate AuthAPI
    BusinessUser->>UI: Submit new business record
    UI->>APIGW: POST /api/records with Bearer token
    APIGW->>RecordsAPI: Forward create request
    activate RecordsAPI
    RecordsAPI->>RBAC: Evaluate Records.Create permission
    alt Permission granted
        RBAC-->>RecordsAPI: Allowed
        RecordsAPI->>SQLDB: INSERT business record
        SQLDB-->>RecordsAPI: Record identifier
        RecordsAPI->>AuditService: Log RecordCreated event
        AuditService->>SQLDB: INSERT audit entry
        RecordsAPI-->>UI: 201 Created
        UI-->>BusinessUser: Show confirmation
    else Permission denied
        RBAC-->>RecordsAPI: Denied
        RecordsAPI->>AuditService: Log AccessDenied event
        RecordsAPI-->>UI: 403 Forbidden
        UI-->>BusinessUser: Show access denied message
    end
    deactivate RecordsAPI
    deactivate UI